					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "CIRCLE\n\nThe Circle node constructs circular geometry  with a given radius and resolution.\n\nThe UV parameters of the node are hidden by default but can be accessed through by right clicking the node and navigating to View.\n\nThe UV inlet takes a Box2D type which can be constructed with the Box2D node or Bounding Box node.\n\nBelow you can find two examples that use the Rectangle node and all its parameters."
					}
				},
